                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 European War 1939/10388: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Egypt</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Kirk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-04-30T20:00:00-04:00">April 30, 1941—8 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>108. Your 349, April 27. Department approves of your action in this matter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
